---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="family" title="Family Events" active="family-events" pageMark="👪">
  Stories tied to a specific <a href={`${base}families`}>family class</a>, meaning the Champions,
  Clerics, Hunters, Landowners, Patrons, Riders, Sages, Statesmen, Traders and Artisans. They fire only
  for a family of that class, or are about one, and they range from Family Traditions to diplomacy and
  city events coloured by the class. The trigger chip names the family class. Unlike the wonder,
  project and building pages, this page collects stories that also appear under their own event class
  or trigger on <a href={`${base}events`}>Story Events</a>. A weight is the value in the XML rather
  than a real in-game chance, because character and empire conditions filter what is eligible.
</EventGroupPage>
